a es el conocimiento y la práctica acumulada por los médicos a lo largo de su carrera, que se integra en la toma de decisiones médicas.", "SENSIBILIDAD Y HABILIDADES DE COMUNICACIÓN:La sensibilidad y habilidades de comunicación son esenciales para comprender el contexto del paciente y sus necesidades en la atención médica.", "EVIDENCIA DE CALIDAD:La evidencia de calidad se refiere a la validez y relevancia de los datos utilizados en la práctica clínica, que son fundamentales para la toma de decisiones informadas.", "SACKETT:Sackett is a key figure in the development of evidence-based medicine, contributing to the creation of clinical guidelines", "STRAUSS:Strauss is involved in the ongoing development and editing of clinical guidelines related to evidence-based medicine", "PICO:PICO is a strategy used in evidence-based medicine to formulate clinical questions regarding patients, interventions, controls, and outcomes", "POEM:POEM stands for Patient Oriented Evidence that Matters, focusing on evidence that is relevant to patient outcomes", "GUÍAS DE PRÁCTICA CLÍNICA:GUÍAS DE PRÁCTICA CLÍNICA are structured recommendations designed to enhance patient care by utilizing the best available evidence. These guidelines serve as evidence-based recommendations that assist healthcare professionals in making informed decisions regarding patient treatment and management.", "LITERATURA MÉDICA:", "BMJ CLINICAL EVIDENCE:BMJ Clinical Evidence is an online resource providing updated summaries of integrated evidence for clinical practice.", "DYNAMED:DynaMed is a clinical decision support tool that offers evidence-based information to healthcare providers.", "INFORETRIEVER:InfoRetriever is an online tool designed to help healthcare professionals find relevant clinical information quickly.", "FISTERRA:Fisterra is a medical resource providing evidence-based information and guidelines for healthcare professionals in Spanish-speaking countries.", "COCHRANE COLLABORATION:The Cochrane Collaboration publishes systematic reviews and clinical trials to provide high-quality evidence for healthcare decision-making."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}